<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Application Approved</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
      .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
       .password { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background: #f0f4ff; color: #007bff; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 8px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 20px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Congratulations, <%= name %>!</h2>
      <p>Your application to join Power Guard as a technician has been reviewed and approved.</p>
      <p>You can now log in using the following random temporary password and start managing your account and resolve outages.</p>

      <% if (randomTechnicianPassword) { %>
        <div class="password"><%= randomTechnicianPassword %></div>
      <% } %>
      <p style="color: red;">Log in now and update your password as soon as possible.</p>
      <div class="footer">&copy; Power Guard. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
